        "official_en_sha256": "38a4f07d87ce952d6f06835e1f0924a5134403e8f6a74390f75c2f1d11496241"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そうか。\r\n入りたくなったらいつでも言うのじゃぞ。",
        "official_en": "Very well. You shall inform me when you wish to enter Fina’s Psyche.",
        "real_en": "I see. Just tell me whenever you want to enter."
      },
